46	Desenvolvimento de um sistema de monitoramento automático de temperatura	Este trabalho apresenta o desenvolvimento de um sistema electrónico destinado ao monitoramento automático da temperatura. A solução utiliza sensores e microcontroladores para realizar a aquisição dos dados ambientais e disponibilizar informações em tempo real para acompanhamento das condições monitoradas.	\N	RECUSADO	2026-09-07 23:06:16.762	24	1	\N	2026-09-07 23:06:16.762	2026-09-22 22:20:22.545	d	{-0.0692230761051178,0.1215396076440811,0.003499889047816396,0.01125281676650047,0.1109597757458687,-0.0516420379281044,0.0153235150501132,-0.02995605953037739,-0.0005033834604546428,0.08046568185091019,0.03988877683877945,-0.009053606539964676,0.03158348798751831,0.01703199744224548,-0.03651992976665497,-0.06257092207670212,0.01524677779525518,-0.002471060957759619,0.08254633843898773,-0.01000793185085058,0.07929161936044693,-0.02398485131561756,0.007963329553604126,-0.01276500336825848,-0.05397233366966248,0.0629926323890686,-0.05155053362250328,-0.02371622994542122,-0.03554707765579224,-0.02229960262775421,0.02521882578730583,-0.04208138957619667,0.06496609002351761,0.004797356203198433,0.01014002785086632,0.03481052443385124,0.03694757074117661,-0.03501801937818527,-0.07748023420572281,0.07339102774858475,-0.01363042183220387,-0.07991241663694382,0.046635452657938,-0.007750343531370163,0.03658813238143921,-0.01692925952374935,-0.05784735083580017,-0.01641773618757725,-0.1004917249083519,-0.075438492000103,-0.0330936536192894,-0.09993179887533188,-0.007463555783033371,-0.02050438150763512,-0.01249175611883402,0.01156066544353962,0.03610237687826157,-0.05331488326191902,-0.04074333980679512,-0.08728982508182526,0.04649453982710838,-0.01458329148590565,-0.04827088490128517,0.02624268271028996,0.04393563792109489,0.06866766512393951,0.01723234169185162,0.01837418414652348,0.101867251098156,-0.05989415571093559,-0.06013573706150055,0.01453321054577827,0.05674100667238235,-0.02837035804986954,0.00986